49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, you are right. We must choose a partner who stays, not just a product that leaves.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"- **Kenji**: @Servas, agreed. We need boots on the ground. I’m ready to see the candidates now.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
